## 编译 russh
``` bash
git clone git@github.com:zeroleo12345/russh.git

mise use -g rust@1.88

rm -rf target  &&  cargo build --verbose

l target/debug/*rustssh2*
```


## 发布 rustssh2
``` bash
# 创建 API Tokens: https://crates.io/settings/tokens
cargo login

# 打包文件
#cargo package -p rustssh2 --list
#cargo package -p rustssh2

# 发布
cargo publish -p rustssh2 --dry-run

cargo publish -p rustssh2
# 等效: cargo publish --manifest-path russh/Cargo.toml
```
